# No Comments / Descriptions / Logs

- No `//`, `/* */`, `///` comments or `<summary>` blocks.
- No `[Tooltip]` / `[Header]` attributes.
- No `Debug.Log*` or `print` calls. Guards just `return`.
- No summary, report or documentation files unless explicitly requested.
- Delete existing comments, descriptions and logs in any file you touch.
- Keep chat replies short.